 dir=\"rtl\">בִּשְׁנַת חֲמִשִּׁים שָׁנָה לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.23\">2 K 15:23</a>, etc.; but <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאַרְבַּע עֶשְׂרֵה שׁ׳ לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.13\">2 K 18:13</a>, etc. (often), and <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשָּׁנָה הָאַחַת עֶשְׂרֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.38\">1 K 6:38</a>, etc.; also (c. units), <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשָּׁנָה הָֽרְבִיעִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.24\">Lv 19:24</a> +, etc., + <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.6\">2 K 17:6</a> <em>the ninth year of</em>, etc.; and even (Ges<sup>§ 134 p</sup>) <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּשְׁנַת הַתְּשִׁיעִית לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.1\">2 K 25:1</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:8\" href=\"/Ezra.7.8\">Ezr 7:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.2\">Je 46:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:59\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.59\">51:59</a> + (Kt) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.1\">28:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.1\">32:1</a> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשָּׁנָה</span>).","next":"BDB, שׁנה","prev":"BDB, שָׁנָה"}